From 8e6bb98751ec24a35b547e75c2b24d6632b7b082 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:38:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(2d): Pass starts at (Auto/Inside/Outside) for Bore

Bore takes the shared pass_start parameter of #3316. The ring ladder of
each level is ordered by PassStart::rank through the new motion entry
bore_started. Auto keeps the centre-out walk byte for byte. Outside cuts
the wall ring first and walks in. Inside is the centre-out order, because
a hole has no inner wall.

The field rides EditOperationParams, the MCP edit_operation door and the
project key pass_start (auto never written). The Bore Passes tab shows the
shared row with a Bore hint.

Stacked on #3353.

Fixes #3360

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
